{"content":[{"c":["MIXED MARRIAGE*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Marriages between Jews and Gentiles. Marriages to the original inhabitants of Canaan were forbidden lest Israel become idolatrous (",{"href":"?bref=Deut.7.1-5","r":"Deut.7.1-5","rawR":"Deut.7.1-5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.7.1-5","value":"Deut.7.1-5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 7:1-5"},"; cf. ",{"href":"?bref=2Cor.6.14","r":"2Cor.6.14","rawR":"2Cor.6.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Cor.6.14","value":"2Cor.6.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Cor 6:14"},"). Nevertheless, this prohibition was often neglected in the period of the judges (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.3.6","r":"Judg.3.6","rawR":"Judg.3.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.3.6","value":"Judg.3.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 3:6"},") and thereafter (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.11.3","r":"2Sam.11.3","rawR":"2Sam.11.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.11.3","value":"2Sam.11.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 11:3"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.11.1-8","r":"1Kgs.11.1-8","rawR":"1Kgs.11.1-8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.11.1-8","value":"1Kgs.11.1-8"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 11:1-8"},"). No explicit prohibition was given against marriages with other nationalities (",{"href":"?bref=Num.12.1","r":"Num.12.1","rawR":"Num.12.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.12.1","value":"Num.12.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 12:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Deut.23.7","r":"Deut.23.7","rawR":"Deut.23.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.23.7","value":"Deut.23.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 23:7"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ruth.1.4","r":"Ruth.1.4","rawR":"Ruth.1.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ruth.1.4","value":"Ruth.1.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ru 1:4"},"). After the exile, marriages to Gentiles were repudiated by Ezra and Nehemiah (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.9.1-4","r":"Ezra.9.1-4","rawR":"Ezra.9.1-4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.9.1-4","value":"Ezra.9.1-4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 9:1-4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.13.23-27","r":"Neh.13.23-27","rawR":"Neh.13.23-27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.13.23-27","value":"Neh.13.23-27"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 13:23-27"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=MarriageMarriageCustoms_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"MarriageMarriageCustoms_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"MarriageMarriageCustoms_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Marriage, Marriage Customs"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"MixedMarriage","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Dt 7:1-5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.7.1-5","rawQueryValue":"Deut.7.1-5","sourceRefExact":"Deut.7.1-5"},{"anchorText":"2 Cor 6:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Cor.6.14","rawQueryValue":"2Cor.6.14","sourceRefExact":"2Cor.6.14"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 3:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.3.6","rawQueryValue":"Judg.3.6","sourceRefExact":"Judg.3.6"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 11:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.11.3","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.11.3","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.11.3"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 11:1-8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.11.1-8","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.11.1-8","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.11.1-8"},{"anchorText":"Nm 12:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.12.1","rawQueryValue":"Num.12.1","sourceRefExact":"Num.12.1"},{"anchorText":"Dt 23:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.23.7","rawQueryValue":"Deut.23.7","sourceRefExact":"Deut.23.7"},{"anchorText":"Ru 1:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ruth.1.4","rawQueryValue":"Ruth.1.4","sourceRefExact":"Ruth.1.4"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 9:1-4","canonicalization":"deferred_t